      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nyssa%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Nyssa holds the title of the Oregon city with the lowest median age at twenty-five point one years old.",
